{"speciesId":379,"names":{"fr":"Registeel","es":"Registeel","en":"Registeel","ja":"レジスチル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"REGISTEEL has a body that is harder than any kind of metal. Its body is apparently hollow. No one has any idea what this POKéMON eats."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"REGISTEEL was imprisoned by people in ancient times. The metal composing its body is thought to be a curious substance that is not of this earth."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its body is harder than any other kind of metal. The body metal is composed of a mysterious substance. Not only is it hard, it shrinks and stretches flexibly."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It is sturdier than any kind of metal. It hardened due to pressure underground over tens of thousands of years."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It is sturdier than any kind of metal. It hardened due to pressure underground over tens of thousands of years."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its body is said to be harder than any kind of metal. A study has revealed that its body is hollow."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its body is said to be harder than any kind of metal. A study has revealed that its body is hollow."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Son corps invulnérable fut forgé par la pression souterraine durant des dizaines de milliers d’années."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Son corps invulnérable fut forgé par la pression souterraine durant des dizaines de milliers d’années."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son corps invulnérable fut forgé par la pression souterraine durant des dizaines de milliers d’années."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su cuerpo ha estado sometido a la presión subterránea durante miles de años y no puede arañarse."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Tempered by pressure underground over tens of thousands of years, its body cannot be scratched."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"何万年も 地下の 圧力で 鍛えられた 金属の ボディは 傷ひとつ つかない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son corps, plus dur que n’importe quel métal, serait creux selon les dernières analyses scientifiques."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se dice que su cuerpo es más duro que cualquier metal. Su interior es hueco, según ciertos estudios."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its body is said to be harder than any kind of metal. A study has revealed that its body is hollow."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"どんな 金属よりも 硬いと 言われる 体。調査の 結果 体の 中は 空洞だった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le corps de Registeel est plus dur que n’importe quel métal existant. Il est apparemment creux. Personne ne sait ce que ce Pokémon mange."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"No hay metal que supere en dureza el cuerpo de Registeel, que tiene aspecto de estar hueco. Nadie sabe de qué se alimenta este Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Registeel has a body that is harder than any kind of metal. Its body is apparently hollow. No one has any idea what this Pokémon eats."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"どんな 金属よりも 硬い 体を 持つ。 体の 中は 空洞に なっているらしく 食べている ものも 分からない ポケモンだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il y a très longtemps, Registeel fut emprisonné par les hommes. On pense que l’étrange métal qui compose son corps provient d’une autre planète."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hace mucho tiempo Registeel estuvo preso. La gente piensa que el metal del que está hecho es una curiosa sustancia extraterrestre."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Registeel was imprisoned by people in ancient times. The metal composing its body is thought to be a curious substance that is not of this earth."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"昔 人によって 封印された ポケモン。 体を つくる 金属は 地球上に 存在しない 物質と 考えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il est fait d’une matière mystérieuse plus solide que n’importe quel métal, mais assez souple pour pouvoir s’étirer ou se rétrécir."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Está hecho de una misteriosa sustancia que, pese a ser más dura que cualquier metal, se contrae y dilata con facilidad."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Registeel’s body is made of a strange material that is flexible enough to stretch and shrink but also more durable than any metal."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"伸び縮みする 柔らかさも あるが どんな 金属よりも 頑丈な 不思議な 物質で できている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il paraît qu’il est né dans le manteau terrestre et qu’il en a émergé il y a environ 10 000 ans."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Dicen que se formó en el manto terrestre y ascendió a la superficie hace aproximadamente diez mil años."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It’s rumored that this Pokémon was born deep underground in the planet’s mantle and 